                <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="5" align="center"><b> 
                  US Media should cover UN mission and should not ignore reports</b></font><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b><font size="5"> 
                  from human rights organizations</font></b></font></p>
              </div>
